  "scope": "Let k be an algebraically closed field of characteristic zero, let q in k^* be a primitive third root of unity, and let A=U_q^+(B_2) be the algebra with exactly the two quantum Serre relations frozen in source.md. With e3=e1e2-q^2e2e1, z=e2e3-q^2e3e2, and z1=e1e2e3+e1z/(q^2-1)+e3^2/(q^4-1), one has Z(A)=k[e1^3,e2^3,e3^3,z,z1] and Aut_{Z(A)-alg}(A)={id_A}.",
